
OpenBSD setup script

This script sets a newly installed OpenBSD system up for daily desktop use,
including following options:

- WIFI Network
- MAC Randomizations
- Singe user mode password protection
- Hostname
- doas setup
- Kernel options
	- Hyperthreading
	- Semaphores
	- Shared memory limits
	- system processes
- Installing packages
- Deamon setup
- downloading and installng dotfiles repo

WORK IN PROGRESS
